{"Title":"An Act relative to Group Health Insurance Commission","BillNumber":"H2465","DocketNumber":"HD2021","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:22:23.093"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:22:23.0933333"},{"Id":null,"Name":"David Holway","Type":3,"Details":null,"ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:22:23.0933333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2465/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Chan of Quincy, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2465) of Tackey Chan and David Holway relative to the monthly premium rate for the group health and medical insurance plan for employees of the Commonwealth.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any statute, rule or regulation to the contrary, the commonwealth shall pay (90) percent of the monthly premium rate for the Group Health and Medical Insurance plan for state employees.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}